          <xhtml:span style="font-size: 18.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri;">As of December 31, 2025, we estimate that none of the deferred tax balance in Account 283 could be used in the development of jurisdictional recourse rates.</xhtml:span>
